{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 2"},"body":"Source reading supports the stated bounded navigation relation; this is agent-authored and unreviewed.\n\nInspected: Read full source: compact-chart smooth-neighborhood tests, coordinate Laplace-Beltrami operator, Riemannian Hausdorff measure, eigensequence and both endpoints.\n\nCapture rebinding by Codex, 26 October 2026: the Atlas capture revision changed after an outside-report wording correction. The pinned Lean text, configuration, paper text and proposed relation are unchanged; no new review is implied.","content_sha256":"sha256:7da106f8cf477b78522065bd94817b4fa3b666685b5c41df22972ae33a4faf46","fingerprint":"sha256:776ee6bf74b52ca93ec3333d48b23db3340063aafbdcc462709276bfea7df0ce","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. Source reading supports the stated bounded navigation relation; this is agent-authored and unreviewed.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:4299e40a556682d609c4d3d3b7638416b188f998eddd73d3af26b5749cfd92b1","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.YauCounterexamples.sphere_three"],"explanation":"The sphere_three declaration finds a smooth metric in every smooth neighborhood of the round metric on S3. Its one fixed metric has a sequence of positive-eigenvalue real eigenfunctions with eigenvalues tending to infinity and nodal-area/square-root-eigenvalue ratio tending to infinity, matching the paper main theorem.","fingerprint":"sha256:1d20b2e525288cfc125e228db6d31a2b4a0643ecb6a7ae2d7a3220a80434c568","limitations":"This is an unbounded square-root ratio, not the distinct power-law improvement on S4 t